0:["uw1uS1C327JjxJQIZweEe",[[["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","uhi-mandate-pharmacy-guide","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__?{\"slug\":\"uhi-mandate-pharmacy-guide\"}",{}]}]}]},"$undefined","$undefined",true],["",{"children":["blog",{"children":[["slug","uhi-mandate-pharmacy-guide","d"],{"children":["__PAGE__",{},[["$L1",["$","main",null,{"className":"bg-white py-20","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"mx-auto grid max-w-7xl gap-10 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_320px] lg:px-8","children":[["$","article",null,{"children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center rounded-full px-2.5 py-1 text-xs font-semibold leading-none bg-primary text-white","children":[null,"Regulatory"]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mt-5 font-serif text-5xl font-semibold text-slate","children":"UHI mandate: a practical pharmacy owner guide"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-sm text-slate/50","children":["2026-04-01"," - ",7," min read - ","PharmaConnect"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-10 grid gap-6 text-lg leading-9 text-slate/75","children":[["$","p","Tanzania's universal health insurance launch changes pharmacy operations from a mostly retail workflow into a more formal care, claim, and compliance workflow. Pharmacy owners need reliable stock records, clean claim data, and evidence that dispensing decisions were made responsibly.",{"children":"Tanzania's universal health insurance launch changes pharmacy operations from a mostly retail workflow into a more formal care, claim, and compliance workflow. Pharmacy owners need reliable stock records, clean claim data, and evidence that dispensing decisions were made responsibly."}],["$","p","The immediate operational challenge is not a sophisticated analytics dashboard. It is daily readiness: identify the member, dispense the right product, capture required claim information, keep stock accurate, and preserve the audit trail.",{"children":"The immediate operational challenge is not a sophisticated analytics dashboard. It is daily readiness: identify the member, dispense the right product, capture required claim information, keep stock accurate, and preserve the audit trail."}],["$","p","A safe current product should reduce paperwork, not add a new burden. It should make NHIF claim readiness, expiry awareness, and compliance status visible in the normal dispensing flow.",{"children":"A safe current product should reduce paperwork, not add a new burden. It should make NHIF claim readiness, expiry awareness, and compliance status visible in the normal dispensing flow."}],["$","p","Preparation starts with workflow discipline. Pharmacy owners should know who verifies membership, who reviews claim readiness, who handles rejected claims, and how stock changes are recorded.",{"children":"Preparation starts with workflow discipline. Pharmacy owners should know who verifies membership, who reviews claim readiness, who handles rejected claims, and how stock changes are recorded."}],["$","p","Inventory hygiene matters because claim readiness is weakened when products are not tracked by batch and expiry. FEFO handling protects patients, reduces waste, and supports later review.",{"children":"Inventory hygiene matters because claim readiness is weakened when products are not tracked by batch and expiry. FEFO handling protects patients, reduces waste, and supports later review."}],["$","p","The practical goal is not digitization for its own sake. The goal is fewer rejected claims, safer dispensing, better stock reliability, and clearer evidence when a pharmacy needs to explain what happened.",{"children":"The practical goal is not digitization for its own sake. The goal is fewer rejected claims, safer dispensing, better stock reliability, and clearer evidence when a pharmacy needs to explain what happened."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8","children":["$","$L2",null,{"className":"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-lg font-semibold transition duration-150 disabled:cur